WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
EarthFire brings NASA FIRMS active-fire observations into one interactive dashboard.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Choose a region and date to focus the globe, metrics, and daily fire calendar.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:26.000
Select a calendar day to review MODIS and VIIRS detections and occupied cells.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Switch sensor layers to compare hotspots on the interactive 3D globe.
